{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrobator is a new NES emulator that brings some fresh features to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeline \u2013 Your personal time machine: go back seconds, minutes, or hours, then replay or restart from any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AutoMap \u2013 Remembers the game world around you as you explore, with full zoom/pan controls and wide-screen visibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite Replay \u2013 Little ghost-sprites reenact your past triumphs (and face-plants) on top of the AutoMap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motion Interpolation \u2013 Enhances smoothness by inserting extra frames between existing ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure-sensitive slow-mo/fast-forward and rewind via gamepad triggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution, unmixed audio waveforms with octave adjusters for deeper bass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input lag reduction, CRT TV output filter, trail effects, built-in cheats, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Bonkers Edition</strong> adds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Assistant \u2013 Plug in an AI henchman for voice operation, banter, and other sorcery. <i>OpenAI API key &amp; credit required.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scripting \u2013 Generate audio/visual/voiceover sequences, triggered by in-game events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See  for more information.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282220?t=1760472996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282220?t=1760472996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282220/d8307129082f823105f78b22594a55e7839e60b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760472996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282220/d8307129082f823105f78b22594a55e7839e60b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760472996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrobator is a new NES emulator that brings some fresh features to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeline \u2013 Your personal time machine: go back seconds, minutes, or hours, then replay or restart from any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AutoMap \u2013 Remembers the game world around you as you explore, with full zoom/pan controls and wide-screen visibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite Replay \u2013 Little ghost-sprites reenact your past triumphs (and face-plants) on top of the AutoMap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motion Interpolation \u2013 Enhances smoothness by inserting extra frames between existing ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure-sensitive slow-mo/fast-forward and rewind via gamepad triggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution, unmixed audio waveforms with octave adjusters for deeper bass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input lag reduction, CRT TV output filter, trail effects, built-in cheats, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Bonkers Edition</strong> adds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Assistant \u2013 Plug in an AI henchman for voice operation, banter, and other sorcery. <i>OpenAI API key &amp; credit required.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scripting \u2013 Generate audio/visual/voiceover sequences, triggered by in-game events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See  for more information.</p>","developers":["Arrectis LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282220/header.jpg?t=1760472996","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Arrectis LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3282220/1566754241/35112ecbcc9b8cb14928ed7c2b16eac3d9910c4f/1760471784/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760472993","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3282220/1566754241/35112ecbcc9b8cb14928ed7c2b16eac3d9910c4f/1760471784/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760472993","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3282220/1566754241/35112ecbcc9b8cb14928ed7c2b16eac3d9910c4f/1760471784/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760472993","id":257072848,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072848/movie480.mp4?t=1760472993","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072848/movie_max.mp4?t=1760472993"},"name":"Features","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257072848/37af4dac1154bf38c2e55a7d23b117d6b29d52b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760472993","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072848/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1760472993","max":"https://video.akamai.st